{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent","id":617976,"title":"Adapting Angeology/Demonology to Descent?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-06T13:05:52-07:00","id":617976,"title":"Adapting Angeology/Demonology to Descent?","content":"just an idea that crossed my mind- did anyone tried to adapt real world angels and demons into NPCs in the game? Personally, I have found inspiration for Raziel in my games and homebrew (although I've never played Demon directly, I did used the God Machine and its angels) where I've made him into the &quot;first Exiled&quot; who seeks to give humanity the secrets for taking over the God Machine, while Samyaza was adapted into some sort of super cryptid who was created as an early experiment in creating angels, only to get out of control and now all he wish is to destroy the Machine and its creations. Did anyone else did something similar?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T13:52:06-07:00","id":618042,"title":"","content":"In my (sadly) short lived Demon game the 'God-Machine' was the sum of all the Infrastructure put into place by the 4 Archangels: Micheal, Raphael, Gabriel, Uriel. Not that the game got far enough to come up...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T16:00:42-07:00","id":618164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent#post617976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">just an idea that crossed my mind- did anyone tried to adapt real world angels and demons into NPCs in the game?</div> </div> </div> </div> While I don't use famous names, I make NPCs based on them all the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T16:02:50-07:00","id":618166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=618042#post618042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my (sadly) short lived Demon game the 'God-Machine' was the sum of all the Infrastructure put into place by the 4 Archangels: Micheal, Raphael, Gabriel, Uriel. Not that the game got far enough to come up...</div> </div> </div> </div> Ohhh! And there was a fifth archangel, who was helping them, but realized it was a Mistake, and thus, Fell. And, ever since then, the war has been going on, with demons following the path to Interlocks to Hell as emblazoned by the First Fallen, set into the very nature of the God Machine by the Morning Star. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T16:54:54-07:00","id":618218,"title":"","content":"I use many real world angels in my game, I find them to be very evocative and play them quite closely to their namesake.<br /> the angels I have used are as follows:<br /> Abraxos<br /> Af<br /> Azriel<br /> Barakiel<br /> Briathos<br /> Eiael<br /> Hashmed/Hasmed<br /> Kalaziel<br /> Rahab<br /> Raziel<br /> Zuriel","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 08-06-2015, 08:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T17:04:54-07:00","id":618227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=618166#post618166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Ohhh! And there was a fifth archangel, who was helping them, but realized it was a Mistake, and thus, Fell. And, ever since then, the war has been going on, with demons following the path to Interlocks to Hell as emblazoned by the First Fallen, set into the very nature of the God Machine by the Morning Star.</div> </div> </div> </div>I may have gone that way with it, but I was defiently going with this:<ul><li>The Archangels were actually the 'Fallen' forms of some entites from another reality.</li> <li>They left their master and came to (or created) earth as their 'Hell'.</li> <li>In order to keep their new 'Hell' secure they made lesser beings in their image, Angels.</li> <li>One of the players was starting a cult to help him achieve his own Hell.</li> <li>And eventually some of his cultists would become disillusioned and rebel against him. Which is around when I would want the Ring to start figuring out about the Archangels.</li> </ul>Oh the grand plans we make..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T17:04:55-07:00","id":618228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=618166#post618166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Ohhh! And there was a fifth archangel, who was helping them, but realized it was a Mistake, and thus, Fell. And, ever since then, the war has been going on, with demons following the path to Interlocks to Hell as emblazoned by the First Fallen, set into the very nature of the God Machine by the Morning Star.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, Samael, the Venom of God","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T01:37:26-07:00","id":618637,"title":"","content":"If I'll ever have the chance of ST a Demon game, my plans for the 4 Archangels is making each of them as a &quot;prototype&quot; for one of the God Machine's angels- Michael is a Sword, Raphael a Shield, Gabriel a Trumpet and Uriel a Wheel. Their patterns are used to make &quot;lesser&quot; versions of them- so if one of them is destroyed (or worse, Fall) the God Machine would lose the ability to make angels of their type.<br /> <br /> Lucifer would be the first Fallen, of course, in which tried to rebel against the Machine but was struck down by Michael and literally fell to Hell (or Inferno). Now, he turned into some sort of a &quot;radio station&quot; which broadcast the &quot;devil signal&quot; in order to lure more angels to Fall and become demons. Samael, on the other hand, would be a some sort of a virus- a personality of an angel which was meant to be erased, yet managed to survive by infecting other angels and using their bodies as hosts (some sort of Agent Smith). Its goal is to infect the whole Heavenly Host until it would reach the Command and Control Infrastructure of the Machine and take over it. Metatron was the first (and perhaps, the only) Integrator to succeed and reestablish a connection with the Machine on its own terms, rising to the level of an Archangel and maintaining most of its independents, something which turned him into Michael's rival at Heaven.<br /> <br /> Still thinking about ideas for Azazel and other angels/demons I am fond of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T09:51:12-07:00","id":619029,"title":"","content":"I tend to have real angels serve as living fundamental laws. Michael, Gabriel, Raphael, and Uriel serve as, with no particular correspondence, as electromagnetism, strong forces, weak forces, and gravity, as an example. If you come across them, that's because the God-Machine thinks there's something more important than keeping reality together,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T11:28:00-07:00","id":620340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=618637#post618637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I'll ever have the chance of ST a Demon game, my plans for the 4 Archangels is making each of them as a &quot;prototype&quot; for one of the God Machine's angels- Michael is a Sword, Raphael a Shield, Gabriel a Trumpet and Uriel a Wheel. Their patterns are used to make &quot;lesser&quot; versions of them- so if one of them is destroyed (or worse, Fall) the God Machine would lose the ability to make angels of their type.<br /> <br /> Lucifer would be the first Fallen, of course, in which tried to rebel against the Machine but was struck down by Michael and literally fell to Hell (or Inferno). Now, he turned into some sort of a &quot;radio station&quot; which broadcast the &quot;devil signal&quot; in order to lure more angels to Fall and become demons. Samael, on the other hand, would be a some sort of a virus- a personality of an angel which was meant to be erased, yet managed to survive by infecting other angels and using their bodies as hosts (some sort of Agent Smith). Its goal is to infect the whole Heavenly Host until it would reach the Command and Control Infrastructure of the Machine and take over it. Metatron was the first (and perhaps, the only) Integrator to succeed and reestablish a connection with the Machine on its own terms, rising to the level of an Archangel and maintaining most of its independents, something which turned him into Michael's rival at Heaven.<br /> <br /> Still thinking about ideas for Azazel and other angels/demons I am fond of.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of Inferno, could an Angel be corrupted into a Demon of the Inferno, like Ghosts and Spirits?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T13:11:09-07:00","id":620442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=618637#post618637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Samael, on the other hand, would be a some sort of a virus- a personality of an angel which was meant to be erased, yet managed to survive by infecting other angels and using their bodies as hosts (some sort of Agent Smith). Its goal is to infect the whole Heavenly Host until it would reach the Command and Control Infrastructure of the Machine and take over it.</div> </div> </div> </div> A thought has just struck me. A quick Wikipedia search shows that Samael is considered an angel of Death in some traditions. According to the first God-Machine story, a &quot;Death Angel&quot; is sealed on the dark side of the moon for introducing mortality or something like that, yes? Except maybe it was sealed for far more... <i>pressing</i> reasons...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T15:30:40-07:00","id":620636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=620340#post620340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of Inferno, could an Angel be corrupted into a Demon of the Inferno, like Ghosts and Spirits?</div> </div> </div> </div>Same caveat as qashmallim and other representatives of fundamental forces \u2014 an angel serves a higher power, and if it doesn't then <i>it's not an angel anymore.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T16:36:29-07:00","id":620708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=620442#post620442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> A thought has just struck me. A quick Wikipedia search shows that Samael is considered an angel of Death in some traditions. According to the first God-Machine story, a &quot;Death Angel&quot; is sealed on the dark side of the moon for introducing mortality or something like that, yes? Except maybe it was sealed for far more... <i>pressing</i> reasons...</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be better to use Azrael as the death angel( because that is who he is), as Samael is Lucifer in most cases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T22:43:03-07:00","id":620929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=620708#post620708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would be better to use Azrael as the death angel( because that is who he is), as Samael is Lucifer in most cases.</div> </div> </div> </div>depends who you ask. In orthodox Judaism, there is no such thing as Lucifer*- angels don't have free will, and so they can't fall. Samael is called &quot;HaSatan&quot;, but he is not a demon, but an angel created to make mankind's life as miserable as possible. He is not connected to any of Lucifer's symbols- no &quot;falling star&quot; or rebellion against God or even commanding demons (unless you count the lesser &quot;evil angels&quot; and his children with Lilith). The king of demons is called Asmodai, and those are an whole different class of beings formed out of Sin, something like Inferno's demons.<br /> <br /> *yeah, there is all the thing about Helel ben Shahar&quot;, but the canon interpetation for it is that it was made to mock the King of Babylon, the god Shahar or both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T08:34:26-07:00","id":621338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/617976-adapting-angeology-demonology-to-descent?p=620340#post620340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of Inferno, could an Angel be corrupted into a Demon of the Inferno, like Ghosts and Spirits?</div> </div> </div> </div> A full angel? Probably not - angels, by nature, try to be detached, while the Inferno really gets into the sins of humanity. An angel would Fall before they'd become corrupt enough to be infernally tainted. At which point, its harder to taint a physical being as opposed to an ephemeral one. Even if the angels did become tainted, the G-M would recall them and fix the issue.<br /> <br /> An Exile? Now THAT is very much a strong possibility. They've very likely lost that angelic detachment, they've lost the backing of the G-M, they are without purpose. They're ripe for corruption.*<br /> <br /> <br /> * I have more details in the homebrew Inferno 2e conversion that I'm working on, details coming soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T00:58:03-07:00","id":711996,"title":"","content":"In a chronicle I'm running, Lucifer and the four Archangels were the first angels and the first of their specific incarnations (this mythology doesn't account for Analysts, but in my game they came later in history, around the industrial revolution) Michael was the first destroyer, Raphael the first Psychopomp, Gabriel the first Messenger and Uriel the first Guardian. Lucifer was a fifth incarnation-or rather, she was a unique creation-a Co-ordinator angel. He was made to oversee other Angels and ensure their continued efficiency. When she finally Fell, the God machine was no longer able to micro-manage It's angels on the human, individual level necessary to keep them totally loyal, and so all angels gained the capacity to Fall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}